    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lirekekha khulwe e Pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami Hesekia aaruma burume khu baandu ba Isiraeli ne Yuda boosi. Aandika lundi chibarwa khu baandu ba Efuraimu ne Manase. Hesekia alaanga babaandu bano boosi mu nju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mu Yerusalemu khukhola Epasaka khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.9.9+NUM.9.10+NUM.9.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 9.9-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omwami ne babemeelesi bewe, ne babaandu boosi mu Yerusalemu bafukiilisiana khukhola Epasaka mu mwesi kukhola khabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali se banyala khukhola Epasaka khu siise siayo tawe. Basaayi se baba betakaasile ne khuboolela babaandu khukhola kimilimo kia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi tawe. Ne lundi babaandu baba bakheebuusia mu Yerusalemu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lirekekha lino liabonekha lilayi khu mwami ne khu baandu boosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babisia khurusia kumulaango, buli abuundu mu Isiraeli, khukhwama Beerisheba khukhwola Dani. Baboolela babaandu beche e Yerusalemu khukhola e Pasaka khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli. Sikila khulwe siise sileeyi babaandu se bakholanga e Pasaka mu bukali nga liaandikwa mu lilaka tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu lilaka lio mwami Hesekia babaandu babukula chibarwa khukhwama khu niye ne babemeelesi bewe bayila mu Isiraeli mwoosi ne mu Yuda. Chibarwa chaboola chili, “Ee baandu ba Isiraeli kobolela Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo. Mwakhola murio Wele alamukobolela enywe musiili balamu babelukha khukhwama khu baami ba Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhaba nga bakuuka benywe ne balebe benywe bakhaaba basuubilwa khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka babwe tawe. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhola babaandu bano baba be khubuna nga mwabene ne muboona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhaluma kimirwe nga bakuuka benywe ne baba tawe. Ne kakhali mwiaane mwabeene khu Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mala mwiche mu Lukaangu lwewe nilwo atakaasa mindali na mindali. Kholela Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe nio akhamuambila lirima likali tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaba ne mukobolela Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, balebe benywe ne babaana benywe bacha khukholelwa siisa ne babaandu ba babaamba mala bakobole mu sibala sino. Sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe ali omulayi lundi owe siisa. Se alamufutarira mwaba ne mumukobolela tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barumwa bacha khukhwama mu lukoba khukhwola khu lundi mu Efuraimu ne Manase; mala bachiililila busa bario boola e Sebuluni. Ne kakhali babaandu babachekheelela ne khu bakhoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne babaandu balala khukhwama mu Asieri mu Manase ne Sebuluni beboombia mala bacha e Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Wele aaba ne babaandu ba Yuda, abaambaasia khukhola niko omwami ne babemeelesi balaka khubirira khu lomo eya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naikara eye Pasaka ekholwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bakali becha alala mu Yerusalemu. Becha khukhola naikara eye kumukaati kukhalimo limela tawe mu mwesi kwa khabili. Baba libuusiana likali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu barakikha kimilimo mala basiula barusiao chi alutare chichaba mu Yerusalemu. Lundi barusiao chialutare choosi che khukhwoseliakho bibiindu biiunya bulayi. Bamwaata chialutare echo mu Litooma lia Kiduroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khu ndaalo eye khumi ne chine eye kumwesi kwa khabili, beera limeeme lie e Pasaka. Ne basaayi ne Balawi baambwa chisoni, nio betakaasa mala bareera biianwa bie khukhwosia mu Lukaangu lwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babukula bubweyaangu bwabwe nga buli lwosi khuloondekhana ne lilaka lia Musa, omundu owa Wele. Basaayi baanyaka khu alutare kamalasile ke chimbosio, niko Balawi babaelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bakali mu libuusiana se betakaasa babene tawe. Balawi beera limeeme lie e Pasaka khulwa buli mundu okhaba omutakaase tawe; nio Balawi batakaasa buli limeeme khulwa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila babaandu bakali khukhwama Efuraimu, Manase, Isakari ne Sebuluni se baba betakaasile tawe, mala balia kamameeme ke e Pasaka. Bakhola niko lilaka lia Musa likaania. Ne kakhali Hesekia abasabila. Aaloma ali, “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Omulayi, beela abo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakhusaaya ewe, Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka babwe. Babeele akhaba ne bakhetakaasile khuloondekhana ne kamalaka ke Lukaangu ke khukhwetakaasa tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aulila Hesekia, mala aonia babaandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baisiraeli ba babao mu Yerusalemu bakhola naikara eye kumukaati kukhalimo limela tawe, khulwe chindaalo saba mu busangaafu bukali. Balawi ne basaayi bafumia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi buli endaalo ne bamwimbila ne kamaani kabwe koosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia alomaloma ne ara kumwoyo mu Balawi boosi babekesia busicha mu milimo kia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naikara ekhola khabili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu balia siakhulia sia naikara khulwe chindaalo saba. Baana biianwa bie kumuleembe ne khusiima Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owe bakuuka babwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio libuusiana lie babaandu boosi bafukiilila khuchiililila khukhola naikara khulwe chindaalo chichiindi saba. Nio bachiililila khulwe chindaalo chichiindi saba mu busangaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekia omwami owa Yuda aelesia libuusiana lie babaandu chiuunwa eelefu ndala ne kamakheese chielefu saba. Ne babemeelesi baelesia libuusiana lie babaandu chiuunwa e elefu ndala ne kamakheese chielefu ekhumi. Basaayi betakaasa bakali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Libuusiana lie babaandu ba Yuda boosi ne basaayi, Balawi ne libuusiana liosi liliama Isiraeli, baakwa babecha mu Isiraeli, ne baakwa ba baamenya mu Yuda, boosi basangaala lukali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
